Subject: [PATCH] JSPI lifecycle hooks and REENTRANT_JSPI fiber stacks

Backport of emscripten-core/emscripten#27698 and #27699 (heads 207f0b7e7 and
0be344623) to the 6.0.9 release, without tests, docs, ChangeLog and codesize
baselines. -sREENTRANT_JSPI gives each JSPI activation its own shadow stack
so promising exports may be re-entered while another is suspended; -sJSPI_HOOKS
needs a Binaryen with the jspi-hooks pass (WebAssembly/binaryen#9102), which
worker-build supplies. Only --tokio=jspi builds depend on this patch.

Base-commit: 4e4223852a0835923411059a3929907d7df1232e (tag 6.0.9),
after wasm-bindgen-marker.patch, epoll-listeners.patch and
noderawsockets-dns.patch. The tools/settings.py hunk is re-indented for the
release.

